# Both images (api and web) are built from the repository root, so everything not listed here is sent to the
# Docker daemon. Keep this list in step with the COPY lines of api/Dockerfile and web/Dockerfile
# (scripts/tests/test_docker_context.sh checks that nothing a Dockerfile needs is hidden).
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
media
data
docs
assets
website
scripts
frontend/android
frontend/ios
api/test
